  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "──福丸さんって、お兄さんとかはいないの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011020040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴゃ……！\r\nえ、あ、あの……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201102/2022011020040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "ああ、ごめんね、いきなり話しかけちゃって\r\nさっき監督が言ってたことなんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "お兄さんがいるなら、少し気持ちを入れるコツが\r\n掴めるようアドバイスできると思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011020050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………そ、その……あ、兄は、いません……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201102/2022011020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "そっか……うん、それじゃあこうしようよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "出番が終わるまで俺のことを兄の信重だと思って\r\n兄様、って呼ぶこと！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011020060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201102/2022011020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "この作品を作っている時だけは、俺は福丸さん……\r\nいや、お敬の本当の兄だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の役者",
    "text": "──というわけで、よろしくな、お敬！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
